    answer: 2,
    explanation: "Temporal metrics in CVSS v3 adjust the Base Score based on time-sensitive factors including Exploit Code Maturity (no public exploit lowers the score), Remediation Level (official patch available lowers the score), and Report Confidence. These factors reduce urgency without changing the underlying vulnerability severity. Environmental metrics (not temporal) reflect organizational compensating controls and asset value.",
