    question: "An airline and a hotel chain build a shared loyalty program. Together they decide which customer attributes will be collected, agree on the analytics that will be run, and both use the resulting profiles for their own marketing. Each stores the data in its own systems. Under GDPR, how are the two companies BEST characterized?",
