    id: "d3_260", domain: 3, difficulty: 2, section: "Hardware Security",
    question: "A virtualization team needs each guest virtual machine to have its own measured boot chain and its own protected storage for BitLocker-style volume keys, without granting guests access to the physical host chip. Which capability should be enabled?",
